          "name": "Consume Flesh",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The Canker cultist is adjacent to the corpse of a creature that died within the last hour, or is carrying a specially prepared lump of decaying flesh.\nEffect The Canker cultist devours a chunk of the corpse or the lump of decaying flesh and regains Hit Points. They regain 1d6 healing Hit Points from consuming the flesh of a creature that died within the last hour, and 2d6 healing Hit Points from the lump.\nThe cultist can regain Hit Points from any given corpse only once.",
