          "name": "Death Burst",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When the bloodsiphon dies, its body explodes in a cloudy red burst of necrotic dried blood in a 20-foot emanation.\nCreatures in range must attempt a check (reflex, dc:21, options:area-effect,damaging-effect) save.\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The creature takes 2d6 void damage.\nFailure The creature takes 4d6 void damage.\nCritical Failure The creature takes 6d6 void damage and is Enfeebled 2 for 1 hour.",
