          "name": "Rejuvenation",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Removing this room's tables and tools allows Jarelle to move on to the afterlife.\nWhen a ghost is destroyed, it re-forms after 2d4 within the location it's bound to, fully healed. A ghost can be permanently destroyed only if someone determines the reason for its existence and sets right whatever prevents the spirit from resting.",
