          "name": "Needle Spray",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The dreshkan braces itself on all four limbs and sprays needles at as many creatures as it would like in a 30-foot cone, dealing 2d4 piercing damage. Each targeted creature in the area must attempt a check (reflex, dc:21, basic, options:area-effect).",
