          "name": "Drover's Band",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Activate command\nFrequency once per day\nEffect The Barbazu exerts his will over a mindless creature within 30 feet. If the target is a mindless creature of 3rd level or lower, it must attempt a check (will, dc:20, options:inflicts:controlled,inflicts:slowed) save and uses an outcome one degree of success worse than the result of its saving throw.\nCritical Success The target creature is unaffected.\nSuccess The target creature is Slowed 1 for 1 round as its responses are muddled by the Barbazu's commands.\nFailure The creature is Controlled by the Barbazu for 1 hour, although it doesn't follow commands that are obviously self-destructive.\nCritical Failure As failure, but the duration is 1 day.",
