          "name": "Infused Items",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Jafaki carries these infused items: 2 Moderate Acid Flasks, 2 Moderate Bottled Lightnings, 2 Moderate Cognitive Mutagens, 2 Lesser Elixirs of Life, 2 Moderate Mistform Elixirs, and 2 doses of Wyvern Poison (one of which they have already applied to their rapier). These items last for 24 hours, or until the next time Jafaki makes their daily preparations.",
