          "name": "Mindfog Aura",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "20 feet. A creature that starts its turn in the aura must succeed at a check (will, dc:23, options:area-effect,inflicts:confused) save or become Confused for 1 round; on a success, that creature is temporarily immune for 1 minute.\nJafaki can suppress or activate this aura as a single action with the concentrate trait.",
