          "name": "Mummy Rot",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "This disease and any damage from it can't be healed until this curse is removed. A creature killed by mummy rot turns to dust and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-rank Resurrect ritual or similar magic.\nSaving Throw check (fortitude, dc:24)\nStage 1 carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)\nStage 2 6d6 void damage and Stupefied 1 (1 day)",
