          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The shanrigol has a creature Grabbed\nEffect The shanrigol squeezes the life essence from its target, dealing 1d10+11 bludgeoning damage] (check (fortitude, dc:25, basic) save).\nThe shanrigol regains temporary Hit Points equal to half the amount of bludgeoning damage a single target takes; these temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute.",
