          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "A shanrigol behemoth's attacks brutally rend its foes. Creatures critically hit by the shanrigol's fleshy slap Strike take an additional 2d6 persistent bleed damage and are Enfeebled 1 for as long as they are bleeding.",
