          "name": "Breath of the Bog",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "30 feet. A creature that begins its turn within the area feels as if its lungs were filling with water and must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:28) save or be unable to speak or breathe. The creature can still hold its breath and can attempt a new save at the end of its turn. A creature that succeeds is temporarily immune for 24 hours.",
