          "description": "Requirements The weapon master is not wielding a weapon.\nEffect The weapon master Interacts to draw a melee weapon without triggering reactions and makes a Strike with that weapon. The target is Off-Guard against this Strike. The weapon master deals an extra 2d8 persistent bleed damage with the Strike.",
