          "id": "wCq8k7oL6F4dMl6U",
          "name": "Pinning Shot",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The archery specialist makes a longbow Strike. If the attack hits, it deals no damage and instead imparts the bow critical specialization effect. If the attack is a critical hit, the target must succeed at two separate Interact actions to pull the missile free.",
