          "description": "Requirements Tino used Retributive Strike on a creature since the start of his previous turn, attempted the Strike it permitted, and didn't critically miss\nEffect Tino throws his whole body into a powerful push. He moves the target 5 feet in any direction and can then attempt to Trip that creature. This is forced movement.",
