          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The rivka opens its maw and projects a 60-foot line of primal energy that deals 14d6 fire damage (check (reflex, dc:32, basic, options:area-effect, traits:fire) save). The type of damage dealt by the ray depends on which kaiju the rivka has most recently fed from (see above). The rivka can't use Kaiju Ray again for 1d4.",
