          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements The shadow yai is in an area of dim light or darkness or is standing in the shadow of any Large or larger object\nEffect The shadow yai instantly teleports to another location that's in dim light or darkness or to a space that's in the shadow of any Large or larger object within 60 feet.",
