          "id": "aT1K6zkwI73D4tJ8",
          "name": "Poisoned Coat",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature adjacent to Blue Viper hits him with a melee unarmed Strike.\nEffect The triggering creature is exposed to Dragon Bile. This consumes the poison, and Blue Viper can't use Poisoned Coat again until he spends 10 minutes applying one dose of contact or injury poison to his clothing.",
