          "description": "10 feet. Yabin is surrounded by magically generated waist-deep poisonous waters. Enemies that enter the water are exposed to his white serpent venom. The aura is difficult terrain for creatures without a swim Speed. Every time Yabin Casts a Spell, the aura increases in radius by 5 feet, up to a maximum of 60 feet. He can activate or suppress this aura as a single action, which has the concentrate trait.",
