          "name": "Entombing Grasp",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements A foe within Stone Ghost's reach is standing on stone or soil\nEffect Stone Ghost briefly extends his intangibility to a foe and drags or pounds them into the earth. He makes an check (athletics, against:fortitude) check against the target's Fortitude DC. On a success, the foe is planted waist-deep in the ground and is Immobilized and Off-Guard until it Escape DC 22. On a critical success, the foe is completely buried and must hold its breath until it is free or else start suffocating. A successful Escape returns the foe to its original square on the surface, or the closest unoccupied square.",
