          "id": "z9nxRoV9X4JXQGKZ",
          "name": "Rejuvenation",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When Bharlen is destroyed, her armor rebuilds its body over the course of 1d10-or more quickly if the armor is worn by a living host. If the body is destroyed before then, the process restarts.\nBharlen can only be permanently destroyed by obliterating her armor (such as with Disintegrate), transporting it to the Forge of Creation, or throwing it into the heart of a volcano.",
