          "name": "Nova Burst",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The sunburst corpse intensifies its light and unleashes a burning blast of energy. It deals 12d8 fire damage to all creatures in a 20-foot emanation (check (fortitude, dc:34, basic, options:area-effect) save). A creature that fails its save becomes Dazzled until the end of its next turn. The sunburst corpse can't use Nova Burst again for 1d4, and its blinding aura becomes inactive during this time.",
