          "description": "A living creature hit by a mohrg's tongue Strike must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:30, options:inflicts:paralyzed) save or become Paralyzed. The creature can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns, and the DC cumulatively decreases by 1 on each attempt.",
