          "name": "Change to Chute",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A Small or larger creature approaches within 20 feet of the top of the stairs\nReaction The stair risers shift downward, forming a steep ramp while exposing lines of razor-sharp blades.\nAll creatures on the stairs must succeed at a check (reflex, dc:32, name:Change to Chute DC, traits:damaging-effect) save or tumble down the chute, taking 2d6 bludgeoning damage], and landing Prone in area A4.",
