          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per turn\nEffect The acolyte makes two unarmed Strikes, or one unarmed Strike and a dueling pistol Strike. If both hit the same creature, combine their damages for the purposes of resistances and weaknesses.\nThe acolyte's multiple attack penalty applies normally to these Strikes.",
