          "name": "Nimble Dodge",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Requirements Skartitch can't use this reaction while encumbered\nTrigger Skartitch is hit or critically hit by an attack made by a creature she can see\nEffect Skartitch gains a +2 circumstance bonus to her Armor Class against the triggering attack.",
