          "description": "Skartitch attempts a Recall Knowledge check against an opponent using the standard DC for a creature of that level. On a success, that opponent is Off-Guard against Skartitch's attacks until the start of her next turn; on a critical success, the opponent is off-guard against Skartitch's attacks for 1 minute.",
