          "name": "Whip Drain",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Requirements Shianshi has a creature Grabbed with her shadow whip\nEffect The grabbed creature must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:41) save or become Drained 2 (Drained 3 on a critical failure). If the creature is already drained, this increases its drained value instead, to a maximum of drained 4.",
